graph TD
    Launch([アプリ起動]) --> AuthCheck{認証済み?}
    AuthCheck -->|未| Onboarding[オンボーディング<br/>full screen modal]
    Onboarding --> SignIn[サインイン<br/>Google / Apple]
    SignIn --> Permission[マイク権限の設定]
    Permission --> Home
    AuthCheck -->|済| Home

    subgraph Tabs[Bottom Tabs]
        Home[ホーム<br/>今の状況]
        Library[ライブラリ<br/>会議一覧・検索]
        Tasks[タスク<br/>横断タスク]
        Settings[設定]
    end

    RecordCTA(( ●録音<br/>中央アクション ))

    Home -.-> RecordCTA
    Library -.-> RecordCTA
    Tasks -.-> RecordCTA
    Settings -.-> RecordCTA

    RecordCTA --> RecSetup[録音セットアップ<br/>full screen modal]
    RecSetup -->|開始| RecActive[録音中]
    RecSetup -->|キャンセル| Tabs

    RecActive -->|一時停止| RecPaused[一時停止]
    RecPaused -->|再開| RecActive
    RecActive -->|停止| Processing[処理中]
    RecPaused -->|停止| Processing
    RecActive -->|破棄| DiscardConfirm{破棄の確認<br/>Dialog}
    DiscardConfirm -->|破棄する| Tabs
    DiscardConfirm -->|録音を続ける| RecActive

    RecActive -.タブ移動可.-> Tabs
    Tabs -.グローバル録音バー.-> RecActive

    Processing --> MeetingDetail[会議詳細]
    Processing -.失敗.-> ProcessError[処理の失敗<br/>再試行導線]
    ProcessError -->|再試行| Processing
    ProcessError -->|後で| MeetingDetail

    Home -->|会議をタップ| MeetingDetail
    Library -->|会議をタップ| MeetingDetail
    Tasks -->|出典会議| MeetingDetail

    subgraph Detail[会議詳細 Stack]
        MeetingDetail --> Summary[要約]
        MeetingDetail --> Transcript[文字起こし]
        MeetingDetail --> DetailTasks[この会議のタスク]
    end

    MeetingDetail -.->|Ask| AskSheet[AI に質問<br/>Bottom Sheet]
    MeetingDetail -.->|その他| MoreSheet[その他の操作<br/>Bottom Sheet]
    MoreSheet --> Export[書き出し<br/>Bottom Sheet]
    MoreSheet --> Rename[タイトル変更<br/>Dialog]
    MoreSheet --> MoveProject[プロジェクト移動<br/>Bottom Sheet]
    MoreSheet --> DeleteConfirm{削除の確認<br/>Dialog}
    DeleteConfirm -->|削除| Library
    DeleteConfirm -->|キャンセル| MeetingDetail

    Library -->|検索| Search[検索<br/>modal]
    Home -->|検索| Search
    Search --> MeetingDetail

    Library -->|プロジェクト絞り込み| ProjectFilter[プロジェクト選択<br/>Bottom Sheet]
    ProjectFilter --> Library
    Library -->|プロジェクトを開く| ProjectDetail[プロジェクト詳細]
    ProjectDetail --> MeetingDetail

    Tasks -->|タスクをタップ| TaskDetail[タスク詳細]
    TaskDetail --> MeetingDetail

    Settings --> Account[アカウント]
    Settings --> Subscription[プラン<br/>modal]
    Settings --> AISettings[AI 処理の設定]
    Settings --> StorageSettings[保存とデータ]

    Offline{{オフライン}} -.状態バナー.-> Tabs
    PermDenied{{マイク権限なし}} -.-> RecSetup
